      "content": "It sounds like the weight has become so unbearable that the idea of *stopping* feels like the only logical solution. Please know that feeling like your existence is the only thing keeping the pressure on is a very common, very painful thought when you're this overwhelmed. If you're truly at a point where the only perceived release is permanent, that's a sign that the pain has become too much to carry alone. There are ways to find that quiet, but they don't have to be final.",
